# ── Bench raw data (keep summaries + docs/ publish set) ───────────────
# Full scheduling / capacity stamped runs are large; keep latest/ + ledgers if desired.
output/bench/scheduling/[0-9]*/
output/bench/capacity/[0-9]*/
